  • Whatever you create with Iceample (sounds, images, videos, projects)
    belongs to you.

Not permitted without the author's prior written permission
  • Copying, modifying, merging, publishing, redistributing, selling,
    renting or sublicensing all or part of this code.
  • Creating derivative works from this code or including it in another
    project.
  • Hosting or distributing a copy of the application, modified or not.
  • Using the name "Iceample", its logo or its icons for another product
    or service.

Viewing or forking this repository through GitHub's features, to the
extent provided by GitHub's Terms of Service, grants you no other rights.

Third-party components
Libraries included in or used by this project (in particular those in
